# cpp slice: the committed crossing counts, nounk build (the campaign gate and wp5_gate/nounk_gate compare every '  P'/'  U' row).
# Re-taken 2026-09-26 for FIX-PLAN WP7 / CAMPAIGN req 19 (amended, R-H31): forward now includes every exported entry point
# the timed loop calls -- host = ak_enc_reset inside each encode_into_* (before the encode entry point) and the two
# ak_dec_reset_<Root> of a retain decode (before and after it), take = the loop's ak_enc_take; retain rows (no pre-placed
# buffer, exact-size grow) and the 92 U-* rows at the shapes roots are added. The core-counted part of every earlier row is
# unchanged: the previous baseline's forward equals 'core' here.
# counts binary built from the working tree at 0457ae483 + the WP7 changes; deterministic.

counting build, linkage=shared, -std=201703
Per-element columns are forward / reverse. forward = core + host + take (req 19):
host = ak_enc_reset inside each encode_into_* (before the encode entry point) and the
two ak_dec_reset_<Root> of an armed (retain) decode (before and after it); take = the
timed loop's ak_enc_take after an encode. Retain: no pre-placed buffer, exact-size grow.

